Order status rules (part 7c)
  PENDING (cash) / PENDING_PAYMENT (UPI) -> CONFIRMED -> ASSIGNED -> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY -> DELIVERED
  - "Confirm order" = status CONFIRMED. For UPI it also means "payment received" (checked by hand
